Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Surprise Attack Plan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 31
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve all come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.02,0:00:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We will definitely support you for the sake of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a shapeshifting device.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.43,0:00:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to disguise yourselves as residents of the other world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.11,0:00:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,to help me carry out the plan to retrieve the fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,However, this device has a time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can’t make it back within the time limit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ll revert to your original forms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and they’ll see right through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who among you is willing to take part in this plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.62,0:00:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, then go on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones you’ll be impersonating
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.27,0:01:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,come from a world called Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Their names are Sparky and Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, I’m Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.18,0:01:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, I’m Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you at last! Come over here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of place is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so desolate here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, look over there in the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, stop keeping us in suspense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.46,0:02:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell us what this place is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is based on data collected by drones from the rift
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,combined with the analysis of the monster remains we defeated earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the mysterious man who’s been fighting us for the fragments is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. The rifts that appeared out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the multicolored fragments possessing divine magical power,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and the mysterious man who’s been sabotaging us from the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.17,0:02:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The answers we’ve been searching for might all be found here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s truly great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We mustn’t let our guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is likely figuring out how to get their hands on our fragments, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.81,0:02:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The real battle is just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.65,0:02:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this place to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.57,0:02:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to reinforce the defenses at Goats’ Village now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, you and the villagers patrol inside Goats’ Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to pilot a drone to infiltrate the enemy base and gather intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t be able to direct the defense for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.29,0:03:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and the enemy might seize the chance to invade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie, lie in wait outside the lab to keep watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,acting as the second line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to speed up work on the safe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,that Planie taught you to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.83,0:03:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stay at your posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Sparky and Paddi have found Weslie and Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re on their way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can always count on Slowy’s arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, Paddi—you’re back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Big Humphrey,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tyger, thanks for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You must remember the names of the residents in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:04:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and the relationships between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn’t hard work; we were just guarding the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, where are Weslie and Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just about to report on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hurry over to the lab and find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You look perfect; no need to worry about being found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.77,0:04:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember your ultimate objective:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to infiltrate the lab and steal the fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Tibbie; she’s very sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll need to think on your feet—don’t blow your cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Tibbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m glad you’re back; Mr. Slowy is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, where is your gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,O-our gear…we accidentally broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just on our way to find Mr. Slowy for repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys look hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we ran all the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, then off you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I spotted a cockroach in the lab earlier—be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just a cockroach; it won’t scare us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky has been afraid of cockroaches since he was little. Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,To think someone would be afraid of cockroaches…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected you to see through such a sophisticated disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.15,0:05:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If your mission fails in the end, then use this whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.26,0:06:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s impossible; we’re so well-prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How could anyone see through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Better safe than sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You all come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You think a ragdoll can beat us? Let’s get ’em!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, the fragment is in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Help me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.13,0:07:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a multicolored fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This place looks unusual; I’d better take a good look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these images?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There seem to be two people over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:07:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it…us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is spying on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.23,0:08:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.23,0:08:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,W-w-who…who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve been looking for me all this time, haven’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you’re the one responsible for creating these rifts and possessing the multicolored fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this? What exactly is your scheme?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need to hand over the fragment you have to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, we have no choice but to capture you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.91,0:08:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and force the answer out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But your people have already been lured outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.99,0:08:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn’t done that, how else would you have shown yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I’m here, no one is going to hurt Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.65,0:09:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a good thing Mr. Slowy had me guard the lab entrance, or I wouldn’t have spotted you sneaking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.86,0:09:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Facing off against you guys is getting more and more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It actually came back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing is incredibly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The air on the grassland is so fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it feels good to be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Goats’ Village end up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Mr. Slowy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all my fault; Mr. Slowy was taken away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fragments were stolen, too.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
